== ws server
the commands for an Ubuntu server

Usage:
  ws server [flags]
  ws server [command]

Available Commands:
  cable       the cable role's check and reload, which its units run
  claude      the claude role's procedures, which its units run
  devtools    the devtools role's procedures, which its units run
  fans        drive the board's fans on the curves of CONFIG until SIGTERM
  git         the git role's checks and procedures, which its units run
  ikeward     the ikeward role's check, install and wait, which its units run
  signoz      SigNoz's steps that the signoz role's units run
  tunnel      the tunnel role's check, wg0's key and wg0, which its units run
